{"id":"665393","name":"玉米面蔬菜团子","author":"给宝贝做的饭","authorId":"1900992","desc":"","cover":"images/665393/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"玉米面","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油菜或菠菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黑木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红萝卜、香菇、黑木耳分别切丝。","img":"images/665393/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"焯水备用。","img":"images/665393/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小油菜焯水，改成小段备用。","img":"images/665393/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋炒散备用。","img":"images/665393/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把以上所有原料混合，加入虾皮，盐、香油拌匀。","img":"images/665393/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入少许面粉增加粘性。","img":"images/665393/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取适量蔬菜，用手使劲攥成团，在玉米面滚两遍，使其均匀沾上。","img":"images/665393/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"依次做好。","img":"images/665393/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"上汽后蒸15分钟即可。","img":"images/665393/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665393/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}